"Aimi Velra is a B-rank Chainer of the Velra family, and has been one for two and a half decades."
"She looks in her early twenties, though Alden guesses she is forty-something."
"She is petite, with a dark ponytail."
"She drives a fiery red stick-shift sports car with a sunroof and dark red leather seats."
"She is freakishly strong and fast, suggesting boosted physical stats."
"She is good with insight chains but can't feel a chain's spheres of influence and balances."
"She can't send mental texts well."
"She is Keiko Velra's older sister and has eight siblings."
"She is Hazel's aunt, Lute's cousin, Corin's niece and Aulia's granddaughter."
"While Glossed she found a spotless mall bathroom, a pearl bracelet, and her ex on crutches."
"Glossed, she drove 200 km/h through Apex and F City, and a drone dropped cupcakes in her sunroof."
"Sent by Corin, she dragged Alden Thorn off a park bench and carried him off in her car."
"She later dropped Alden beside a bookstore in F City."
"To Alden her handshake feels uneven."
"She holds that a B-rank is strong enough to be envied and weak enough to be ignored."
"She is Lute's favorite cousin; a rejuvenator makes her look and feel sixteen."
"As an authorized witness she oversaw Lute's secret class trade with Isabel."
"Katsuro is one of her brothers."
